WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes. A duration is a commitment, not a measured outcome.
Start with the question.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Why sound? Some people prefer a guided voice. Others prefer quiet.
Preference is not efficacy.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Zen12 advertises music, nature, white noise, and guided audio.
These are seller-described features.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
General meditation research does not test this specific product.
There is no independent hour-for-twelve proof.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Try a free test. Choose a quiet spot. Set a 12-minute timer.
Record what you notice. No purchase required.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Before you buy, check consent, privacy, checkout terms,
and what you actually need. Final Vestige independent guide.
